# --- the development rig (2026-08-17) --------------------------------------
# ⚠ ALL OF THIS STAYS ON DISK - it is untracked, not deleted. The repo is for
# someone who wants to RUN or BUILD the Toolset on Windows, and none of it is
# needed for either: `app\build_exe.ps1` -> `tools\build_app.py` ->
# `tools\pack_addon.py` -> `tools\verify_exe.py` is the whole build chain.
#
# ⚠⚠ `specs\` is not merely unneeded - its own README says **"Nothing in this
# folder may ship readable"**. The plain-text node-group captures were public
# from the first public commit until this one. Removing them here stops any
# further exposure; it does NOT erase them from the git history.
tests/
specs/
tools/gen_pitfalls.py
tools/mainthread_profiler.py
tools/pack_spec.py

# --- local-only deployment detail ------------------------------------------
# ⚠ The licence server URL. `app\licensing\manager.py` falls back to the
# MADI_LICENSE_SERVER environment variable without it, so a clone still runs -
# but a BUILD made without it cannot sign in, and verify_exe.py fails the build
# rather than letting that ship.
app/licensing/endpoint.py

